{1}{Who are you, sir?}{Who are you, ma'am?}{}{}{}{}
{2}{My name is @pcname@. And you are?}{}{5}{}{20}{}
{3}{My name would mean nothing to you. I'm merely a traveler passing through.}{}{5}{}{20}{re -5}
{4}{Me @pcname@}{}{-4}{}{20}{}
{5}{You and me not know. Me traveler.}{}{-4}{}{20}{re -5}
{20}{My name is Elisabeth Blafard. Have you ever heard that name? [She looks deeply troubled.]}{My name is Elisabeth Blafard. Have you ever heard that name? [She looks deeply troubled.]}{}{}{}{}
{21}{No. Who are you?}{}{5}{}{40}{}
{22}{Has someone by that name disappeared? You seem deeply troubled.}{}{5}{}{40}{re +5}
{23}{No. Who you?}{}{-4}{}{40}{}
{24}{Why you sad with @pcname@?}{}{-4}{}{40}{re +5}
{40}{I am Professor Quentin Blafard's wife. He vanished recently without a trace... [She lowers her head, wipes her eyes, then continues through her tears.] I haven't heard from him in weeks... The authorities in Malicorne suspected him of sorcery... Yet while he devoted himself to new technology, I was the one who practiced magic...}{I am Professor Quentin Blafard's wife. He vanished recently without a trace... [She lowers her head, wipes her eyes, then continues through her tears.] I haven't heard from him in weeks... The authorities in Malicorne suspected him of sorcery... Yet while he devoted himself to new technology, I was the one who practiced magic...}{}{}{}{}
{41}{Was your husband punished in your place?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{100}{lf1 1}
{42}{The authorities have outlawed magic within the city...}{}{5}{lf3 0}{-11}{ru2242, lf3 1}
{43}{Where is the city of Malicorne?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{60}{lf2 1}
{44}{Husband punished for Elisabeth?}{}{-4}{lf1 0}{100}{lf1 1}
{45}{Malicorne not like magicians...}{}{-4}{lf3 0}{-11}{ru2242, lf3 1}
{46}{Where Malicorne?}{}{-4}{lf2 0}{60}{lf2 1}
{60}{Follow the path east until you reach a bridge. Malicorne lies beyond it.}{Follow the path east until you reach a bridge. Malicorne lies beyond it.}{}{}{}{}
{61}{Was your husband punished in your place?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{100}{lf1 1}
{62}{Then the authorities forbid magic in the city, if I understand you correctly...}{}{5}{lf3 0}{-11}{ru2242 1, lf3 1}
{63}{Husband punished for Elisabeth?}{}{-4}{lf1 0}{100}{lf1 1}
{64}{Malicorne not like magicians...}{}{-4}{lf3 0}{-11}{ru2242, lf3 1}
{80}{Mayor Robert Murray rules Malicorne as a dictator. His men hunt mages even beyond the city walls. Most of the city's inhabitants are prisoners within it. Escape is impossible without magic... which is how I got out.}{Mayor Robert Murray rules Malicorne as a dictator. His men hunt mages even beyond the city walls. Most of the city's inhabitants are prisoners within it. Escape is impossible without magic... which is how I got out.}{}{}{}{}
{81}{Was your husband punished in your place?}{}{5}{lf1 0}{100}{lf1 1}
{82}{Where is the city of Malicorne?}{}{5}{lf2 0}{60}{lf2 1}
{83}{Husband punished for Elisabeth?}{}{-4}{lf1 0}{100}{lf1 1}
{84}{Where Malicorne?}{}{-4}{lf2 0}{60}{lf2 1}
{100}{No. My magical skills have always escaped the mayor's notice... Quentin, however, suddenly became secretive one day. My questions taught me nothing. It was as though he refused to share his secret to protect me from drawing the authorities' suspicion...}{No. My magical skills have always escaped the mayor's notice... Quentin, however, suddenly became secretive one day. My questions taught me nothing. It was as though he refused to share his secret to protect me from drawing the authorities' suspicion...}{}{}{}{ru2243}
{101}{[She continues.]}{}{1}{}{110}{}
{110}{I cannot return to Malicorne now. When Quentin disappeared, I felt that I would be next; they must be searching for me by now... I don't know you, sir, but... you are a stranger there. Would you help me find my husband?...}{I cannot return to Malicorne now. When Quentin disappeared, I felt that I would be next; they must be searching for me by now... I don't know you, madam, but... you are a stranger there. Would you help me find my husband?...}{}{}{}{}
{111}{I'll find Professor Blafard... Dead or alive...}{}{5}{}{130}{qu1300 2, lf5 1}
{112}{I need time to consider it. Goodbye.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf4 1}
{113}{Aargh!!!}{}{-4}{}{130}{qu1300 2, lf5 1}
{114}{Me not know now. Goodbye.}{}{-4}{}{0}{lf4 1}
{130}{I am so grateful, sir! I will teleport you to the city gates now. I suggest you search our home in the residential district; perhaps you will find a clue there... Be careful, and beware of the mayor and his guards... Good luck!}{I am so grateful, madam! I will teleport you to the city gates now. I suggest you search our home in the residential district; perhaps you will find a clue there... Be careful, and beware of the mayor and his guards... Good luck!}{}{}{}{}
{131}{E:}{}{1}{}{-6}{}
{150}{Have you given it some thought?}{Have you given it some thought?}{}{}{}{}
{151}{I'll do my best to find your husband.}{}{5}{}{130}{qu1300 2, lf5 1}
{152}{I don't know yet. Goodbye.}{}{5}{}{0}{lf4 1}
{153}{Aargh!!!}{}{-4}{}{130}{qu1300 2, lf5 1}
{154}{Still not know. Goodbye.}{}{-4}{}{0}{lf4 1}
{170}{All my hopes rest in you, sir.}{All my hopes rest in you, madam.}{}{}{}{}
